Please find the Q2 2016 inspection status for the ATU-100. The full-unit thickness survey was completed by Larkhall NDE Services Inc. as detailed in LNDE-RPT-20160118-004-R0. This survey covered the 10-year Class 2 intervals, 5-year Class 1 intervals, and the 3-year intervals for rich amine and regenerator overhead circuits.

We are continuing to implement the CUI program as specified in QSCP-IP-ATU100 Rev 2, ensuring that insulated lines within the CUI range receive profile RT or insulation windows every 5 years.

